.TH SDL_DialogFileFilter 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_DialogFileFilter \- An entry for filters for file dialogs.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_dialog.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef struct SDL_DialogFileFilter
.BI "{
.BI "    const char *name;
.BI "    const char *pattern;
.BI "} SDL_DialogFileFilter;
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION

.BR name
is a user-readable label for the filter (for example, \(dqOffice document\(dq)\[char46]
.PP
.BR pattern
is a semicolon-separated list of file extensions (for example, \(dqdoc;docx\(dq)\[char46] File extensions may only contain alphanumeric characters, hyphens, underscores and periods\[char46] Alternatively, the whole string can be a single asterisk (\(dq*\(dq), which serves as an \(dqAll files\(dq filter\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This struct is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_DialogFileCallback (3type),
.BR SDL_ShowOpenFileDialog (3),
.BR SDL_ShowSaveFileDialog (3),
.BR SDL_ShowOpenFolderDialog (3),
.BR SDL_ShowFileDialogWithProperties (3)
